  storyText: "Maelstrom Turf\n\nNorthside. The old All Foods plant hums with red light. Maelstrom gangers with more chrome than skin guard the gate. Doc Mori's crate sits in plain view.\n\nMirage: \"Their cameras are old. I can blind them.\"\n\n1. Sneak in while Mirage blinds the cameras.\n2. Offer the shard to their boss.\n3. Go in guns blazing."
